Modifications made to the original icons (Apache License 2.0, section 4(b)):
- path coordinates rescaled from viewBox "0 -960 960 960" to "0 0 24 24"
  (same geometry, no redrawing)
- degenerate helper subpaths with zero area removed
- each icon split into parts (outline plus its holes) and animated
- output in two formats: animated SVG (SMIL) and Android
  AnimatedVectorDrawable XML, each in a loop and a one-shot variant
Every modified file carries a comment stating its origin and the changes.

